  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "El cuaderno bien llevado",
    "overview": "The category standard played straight, at the craft bar of Brightwheel and ClassDojo. Identity lives in precise details: the logo's ring green, the logo's letter colours as section identity, and the Enterado confirmation.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Cool green-tinted canvas, white borderless cards.",
      "One accent: SCS forest green.",
      "The SCS stripe: the logo's three letters as a 4px stripe under every header.",
